    "heading": "Magic Item Rarity",
    "lineStart": 14656,
    "lineEnd": 14660
  },
  "section": "10.13",
  "rulesText": "Every magic item has a rarity, which provides a rough measure of an item's power relative to other magic items. The rarities are shown in the Magic Item Rarities and Values table.\n\nCommon magic items, such as a Potion of Healing, are the most plentiful. Artifacts, such as the Dragon Orb, are priceless, unique, and difficult to acquire."
}
